Here is the generated code to evaluate:

<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<span id="demoNarration" style="display:block;margin:0;font-size:10px;line-height:1.35;max-width:270px">The region has one hole, so its boundary has two components. The outer boundary C1 is oriented counterclockwise, while the inner boundary C2 is oriented clockwise so that the region always stays on the left as the boundary is traversed.</span>
